1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:04,320
(Raj:)It's interesting your father
didn't help around the house

2
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:06,320
(Raj:)and Howard doesn't help, either,

3
00:00:06,322 --> 00:00:07,792
(Raj:)so... in a way,

4
00:00:07,790 --> 00:00:10,160
(Raj:)Howard's not only
like your father,

5
00:00:10,159 --> 00:00:14,899
(Raj:)but he's also like the child
that you're afraid to have.

6
00:00:15,765 --> 00:00:17,895
(Howard:)Why are you still here?

7
00:00:19,969 --> 00:00:21,739
(Raj:)Fine, I'll leave.

8
00:00:21,737 --> 00:00:24,877
(Raj:)But it sounds like
somebody needs a fresh diaper.

9
00:00:29,946 --> 00:00:31,316
(Bernadette:)All right...

10
00:00:31,314 --> 00:00:34,384
(Howard:)I admit...
that I don't help out a lot.

11
00:00:34,383 --> 00:00:37,113
(chuckles softly)
And I need to work on that.

12
00:00:37,119 --> 00:00:38,249
(Howard:)But...

13
00:00:38,254 --> 00:00:39,784
(sighs) if we had a kid,

14
00:00:39,789 --> 00:00:41,059
(Howard:)it would be different.

15
00:00:41,057 --> 00:00:42,687
(Bernadette:)Why?
Because...

16
00:00:42,692 --> 00:00:45,022
(Howard:)when my dad left,

17
00:00:45,027 --> 00:00:47,397
(Howard:)I promised myself that...

18
00:00:47,396 --> 00:00:51,836
(Howard:)if I ever had a chance
to be a father...

19
00:00:51,834 --> 00:00:54,234
(Howard:)I'd always be there.

20
00:00:55,771 --> 00:00:57,941
(Bernadette:)Okay, I'll think about it.

21
00:00:57,940 --> 00:01:00,020
(Howard:)And this an actual
“I'll think about it,”

